17592186045417] [17592186320814 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "353ff421-65f8-59eb-b8ea-71a83d1ce946" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186320814 #edb/ref 1074 "Let $u={log}_{5}⁡({x}^{2}).$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}\\cdot 2x=\\frac{2}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}\\,⟹\\,\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}{2}\\cdot \\text{d}u=\\frac{\\text{d}x}{x}.\n$$\n\nCalculating the limits for $u$ gives the following:\n\n| $x$ | $5$ | $125$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $2$ | $6$ |\n\nWe now substitute and evaluate as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{5}^{125}\\frac{8}{3x{log}_{5}⁡({x}^{2})}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{8}{3}{\\int }_{5}^{125}\\frac{1}{{log}_{5}⁡({x}^{2})}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{x} \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{3}{\\int }_{2}^{6}\\frac{1}{u}\\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}{2}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{4\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}{3}{\\int }_{2}^{6}\\frac{1}{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{4\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}{3}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡|u|){|}_{2}^{6} \\\\  & =\\frac{4\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}{3}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡6-\\operatorname{ln}⁡2) \\\\  & =\\frac{4\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡3 \\\\  & =(\\frac{4}{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡3)\\operatorname{ln}⁡5\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186339540 #edb/ref 1080 "2\\sqrt{\\operatorname{ln}⁡8}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186339540 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186339540 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "2eafeb14-c8c5-545b-a26c-84a8ffdb3bb1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186339567 #edb/ref 1080 "\\operatorname{ln}⁡8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186339567 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186339567 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "31f0df20-fa82-5df5-ac98-2f11e0f712be" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186339635 #edb/ref 1080 "\\operatorname{ln}⁡{x}^{7}\\operatorname{ln}⁡|{log}_{7}⁡(4x)|+C" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186339635 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [175921863396